Write the title of one event in a family record: what a picture shows beside the person, a complete phrase of 2 to 4 words that makes sense read alone and says what changed for that person. Use no names. Good: "Lost his job", "Stayed out of it", "Started drinking again". Bad: "Stayed out of" (cut off), "Job" (says no change). Reply with the title only.

Kind of event: {{ kind }}
What happened: {{ description }}
Notes: {{ notes }}
